# Free-tier Gemini quota is counted per key per day (500 requests for
# flash-lite), and a full `python -m eval.eval` run costs about 93. Configure
# more than one key and src/gemini.py moves to the next when one is spent, so
# a run doesn't stop partway and quietly drop its hardest questions.
# Only GEMINI_API_KEY_1 is required. GEMINI_API_KEY_3/_4 also work.
GEMINI_API_KEY_1=""
GEMINI_API_KEY_2=""
